# server, client, design, tech lead, as many as it takes; last matching rule wins. The contract-approval workflow resolves owners per file and requires every owner of
# every file the pull request touches. A contract file matched by no rule fails the check.
# Owners are individual logins: the workflow matches each owner against review logins and does not
# expand a team, so an area that names @org/team can never be approved.

